    renamed or removed, and a string defined twice (the later one silently won) was
    reduced to one definition.
  * !seen: the French module was almost entirely missing (every !seen reply raised a
    Tcl error in French); added. Some seen.* strings were in the wrong language.
  * "set defaultlang xx" with a language that has no file raised a Tcl error and then
    printed a second, wrong message. It now answers once (egg.5) and stops.
