 2026-09-30 TehPeGaSuS  <25697531+TehPeGaSuS@users.noreply.github.com>
  * BadChan: new per-channel option "badchanall" (+/-), off by default (issue #12).
    When on, BadChan has no exceptions: it also checks users added to the bot
    (except flags) and the ops/voices/halfops protected by oprotect, vprotect
    and hoprotect. The bot itself is always skipped, the channel exceptions
    (+#chan) still apply and the other modules are not affected.
  * manual for the new option (man badchanall) in en/es/fr/ro, and docs.html
  * version 2.5.6
  * AutoUpdate: updates now come from the TehPeGaSuS/BlackTools-TCL repository
    (its default branch). The owner and repository are set at the top of
    BT.AutoUpdate.tcl (black(update_owner), black(update_repo)). The changelog
    link shown after an update points there too (the Spanish one was broken).
  * VERSION: SIZE is the number of files under BlackTools/ (80). It had been left
    at 78, so the updater could never tell that the download was complete.
